    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "omg i just spilled a whole pot of boiling pasta water on my arm... its huge and so red and it's already starting to get these big blisters. it hurts so bad im literally shaking. i don't want to go to the er if i dont have to, can i just put some thick coconut oil or maybe concentrated tea tree oil on it to stop the stinging and keep it from getting infected? is that okay to just do at home?",
